31	    \bigl(s^{\tt int}, s^{\tt det}, d^{\tt int}, d^{\tt det}\bigr) \triangleq \bigl(s(\tau_{\tt int}), s(\tau_{\tt det}), d(\tau_{\tt int}), d(\tau_{\tt det})\bigr)
